			D.P.
			80
		</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
			344
		</span></i>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πορθμεῖον</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, <i>ship, boat,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				753
			</span></i>(lyr.), <i><span class="en">
